{"id":"serie","lemma":"serie","pos":"noun","rank":1060,"glosses":["series (a number of things that follow one another)","series (a television or radio program with several episodes)","series"],"ipa":"/ˈseɾje/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"series"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-serie.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cual es tu serie de televisión favorita?","en":"What's your favorite TV series?","words":[{"g":"suchlike"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"television"},{"g":"favorite/favourite","l":"favorito"}]},{"text":"A las ocho empieza mi serie favorita.","en":"My favorite show starts at eight.","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"eight"},{"g":"to start","l":"empezar"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"favorite/favourite","l":"favorito"}]},{"text":"Suelo ver series de madrugada.","en":"I usually watch late-night shows.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/819738","words":[{"g":"dirt"},{"g":"to see, to spot"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"in the wee hours"]]},{"text":"Ellos dieron una serie de conciertos.","en":"They gave a series of concerts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589907","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"concert","l":"concierto"}]},{"text":"La serie se canceló solo después de una pocas semanas.","en":"The series was canceled after just a few weeks.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to cancel, call off","l":"cancelar"},{"g":"sole"},null,null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"little, not much","l":"poco"},{"g":"week","l":"semana"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"after"]]}]}